// kwxTypeScript port of samples/drawing/drawing.cpp (wxWidgets 3.3.x).
//
// The C++ sample is a wxApp subclass + wxFrame + wxScrolledWindow canvas that
// exercises the wxDC API.  This port keeps the same frame, menus, status bar,
// canvas, drawing routines and event behaviour.
//
// Known binding gaps are documented in the final report; see also the comments
// marked "BINDING GAP" below.

